### Hotel Recommendation Near Dubai Sports City (1-Night Stay)

For a one-night stay near Dubai Sports City, I recommend searching hotels in the immediate area (Dubai, UAE). The location's coordinates are approximately 25.041351° N, 55.219654° E, with 68 hotels available within a short distance (many in nearby residential and commercial zones like Motor City or Dubai Production City).

Assuming a stay on the earliest available attraction date (**November 2, 2024**, checking out November 3, 2024) for 1 adult and 1 room, here are some top options based on proximity, popularity, and value (sorted by popularity; prices are approximate and may vary—check real-time for exact rates):

